{"kind": "mod", "id": 2594, "name": "Player Boss Scav", "slug": "player-boss-scav", "teaser": "Standalone component from APBS. Allows your scav to generate as a boss with a configurable chance.", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 8151, "favourites": 16, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.acidphantasm.playerbossscav", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-08-05T06:03:56.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-02-17T06:35:23.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-02-17T06:35:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<h1>THIS IS NOT COMPATIBLE WITH APBS</h1>\n<h2>This feature is already in APBS.</h2>\n<hr />\n<p>Default chance is 5%</p>\n<p>Player Scav can be any of these bosses:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>bossBoar</li>\n<li>bossBully</li>\n<li>bossGluhar</li>\n<li>bossKilla</li>\n<li>bossKillaAgro</li>\n<li>bossKnight</li>\n<li>bossKojaniy</li>\n<li>bossKolontay</li>\n<li>bossPartisan</li>\n<li>bossSanitar</li>\n<li>bossTagilla</li>\n<li>bossTagillaAgro</li>\n<li>bossZryachiy</li>\n<li>followerBigPipe</li>\n<li>followerBirdEye</li>\n<li>sectantPriest</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bosses can be removed from the list via the Config.</p>\n<p><em>Please copy and paste, if you don’t then it’s not going to remove it.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Player Boss Scav</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-playerbossscav</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.12", "content_length": 6687, "downloads": 332, "published_at": "2026-02-17T06:35:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2594/player-boss-scav/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.12", "content_length": 6679, "downloads": 6951, "published_at": "2026-02-17T19:32:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2594/player-boss-scav/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 10291, "downloads": 868, "published_at": "2026-08-05T02:29:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2594/player-boss-scav/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}